\begin{itemize}
\item We introduce Concept Conductor, a novel framework for multi-concept customization, preventing attribute leakage and layout confusion through multipath sampling and self-attention-based spatial guidance.
\item We develop a concept injection technique, utilizing shape-aware masks and feature fusion to ensure harmony and visual fidelity in multi-concept image generation.
